{"classData":[{"comment":"/**\n * @summary Main Thread Addon for High-Performance Grid Drag Scrolling.\n *\n * This addon moves the drag-to-scroll logic from the App Worker to the Main Thread.\n * By handling `mousemove` and `touchmove` events directly in the UI thread, it eliminates the latency\n * and overhead of passing high-frequency messages between workers, resulting in\n * smoother, native-like scrolling performance for both mouse and touch users.\n *\n * It listens for `mousedown` or `touchstart` on the grid body, then attaches global `mousemove` / `touchmove` and\n * `mouseup` / `touchend` listeners to handle the drag operation, supporting \"over-drag\" (scrolling\n * continues even if the mouse / finger leaves the grid bounds).\n *\n * **Kinetic Scrolling:**\n * The addon implements physics-based inertial scrolling. When a user releases a drag with sufficient velocity,\n * the grid continues to scroll with a decay animation, simulating momentum and friction.\n *\n * @class Neo.main.addon.GridDragScroll\n * @extends Neo.main.addon.Base\n */","meta":{"filename":"GridDragScroll.mjs","lineno":4,"columnno":0,"path":"/Users/tobiasuhlig/.neo-ai/agents/neo-opus-grace/neomjs/pages/node_modules/neo.mjs/src/main/addon","code":{}},"summary":"Main Thread Addon for High-Performance Grid Drag Scrolling.\n\nThis addon moves the drag-to-scroll logic from the App Worker to the Main Thread.\nBy handling `mousemove` and `touchmove` events directly in the UI thread, it eliminates the latency\nand overhead of passing high-frequency messages between workers, resulting in\nsmoother, native-like scrolling performance for both mouse and touch users.\n\nIt listens for `mousedown` or `touchstart` on the grid body, then attaches global `mousemove` / `touchmove` and\n`mouseup` / `touchend` listeners to handle the drag operation, supporting \"over-drag\" (scrolling\ncontinues even if the mouse / finger leaves the grid bounds).\n\n**Kinetic Scrolling:**\nThe addon implements physics-based inertial scrolling. When a user releases a drag with sufficient velocity,\nthe grid continues to scroll with a decay animation, simulating momentum and friction.","kind":"class","name":"GridDragScroll","augments":["Neo.main.addon.Base"],"memberof":"Neo.main.addon","longname":"Neo.main.addon.GridDragScroll","scope":"static","$longname":"Neo.main.addon.GridDragScroll","$kind":"class","id":9477,"neoClassName":"Neo.main.addon.GridDragScroll"},{"comment":"/**\n         * @member {String} className='Neo.main.addon.GridDragScroll'\n         * @protected\n         */","meta":{"filename":"GridDragScroll.mjs","lineno":29,"columnno":8,"path":"/Users/tobiasuhlig/.neo-ai/agents/neo-opus-grace/neomjs/pages/node_modules/neo.mjs/src/main/addon","code":{}},"kind":"member","name":"className","type":{"names":["String"]},"defaultvalue":"'Neo.main.addon.GridDragScroll'","access":"protected","longname":"className","scope":"global","$longname":"className","$kind":"property","id":9478,"neoClassName":"Neo.main.addon.GridDragScroll"},{"comment":"/**\n         * Delay in ms before a drag OP starts.\n         * Useful to avoid drag OPs on double-clicks.\n         * @member {Number} delay=100\n         */","meta":{"filename":"GridDragScroll.mjs","lineno":35,"columnno":8,"path":"/Users/tobiasuhlig/.neo-ai/agents/neo-opus-grace/neomjs/pages/node_modules/neo.mjs/src/main/addon","code":{}},"description":"<p>Delay in ms before a drag OP starts.\nUseful to avoid drag OPs on double-clicks.</p>\n","kind":"member","name":"delay","type":{"names":["Number"]},"defaultvalue":100,"longname":"delay","scope":"global","$longname":"delay","$kind":"property","id":9479,"neoClassName":"Neo.main.addon.GridDragScroll"},{"comment":"/**\n         * @member {Number} minDistance=5\n         */","meta":{"filename":"GridDragScroll.mjs","lineno":39,"columnno":8,"path":"/Users/tobiasuhlig/.neo-ai/agents/neo-opus-grace/neomjs/pages/node_modules/neo.mjs/src/main/addon","code":{}},"kind":"member","name":"minDistance","type":{